#: src/app/language/PvExplain.ts:18
msgid "Declares constants: functions without arguments."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/language/PvExplain.ts:19
msgid "Declares a constructor, a function that builds terms such as encryptions; the attacker can apply it unless it is [private]."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/language/PvExplain.ts:20
